# Political Triumph's "when the fourth plan counter is put on this enchantment" triggers for the fourth counter only, not
# the fifth (CR 603.2). With its trigger on the stack after the fourth Ornithopter, Bot1 flashes in Cathar Commando: the
# Commando's own enters trigger resolves first, scrying and putting a fifth plan counter on the enchantment, and nothing
# new triggers - the stack holds the one trigger still. It then resolves once: the enchantment is sacrificed, Bot1 draws one
# card (the Mountain), and every creature Bot1 controls, the Commando included, gets a +1/+1 counter.

